    "why_not": "Counted the affected Run owners and their canvas IPC, renderer and observer callers. Submit, replay, observation and journal recovery retain their distinct entry points. New claim and attachment reads address those callers to one Run. Only the legacy media reader reconstructs a result. The script runner also serves script preview and accepted task recovery. Canvas dispatch owns the paid script transcript receipt. The runtime dispatches mapped multipart transcription through the audio runner."
